  "new-request-choose": {
    "id": "new-request-choose",
    "title": "Choose a service",
    "summary": "To raise a request, you first pick the service you need from the catalog. The catalog has three levels: a category (for example, Human Resources), a sub category (Leave) and a process (Annual Leave Request). Administrators build it in the service catalog.",
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "",
        "kind": "tasks",
        "title": "Choose a service",
        "summary": "To raise a request, you first pick the service you need from the catalog. The catalog has three levels: a category (for example, Human Resources), a sub category (Leave) and a process (Annual Leave Request). Administrators build it in the service catalog.",
        "items": [
          "Pick a process"
        ],
        "toc": [
          {
            "id": "pick-a-process",
            "label": "Pick a process",
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "id": "related-topics",
            "label": "Related topics",
            "level": 2
          }
        ],
        "html": "<figure class=\"shot\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"New Request, the process cards of one sub category, with one card Held and greyed out\"><span class=\"shot-label\">Screenshot</span><figcaption><strong>New Request</strong>, the process cards of one sub category, with one card <strong>Held</strong> and greyed out</figcaption></figure>\n<p>You see only the processes you're allowed to request: those with one of your <a href=\"__DOCS__/user-groups\">user groups</a>. Categories and sub categories with nothing you can request don't appear.</p>\n<p>To open the catalog, select <strong>New Request</strong> in the top menu.</p>\n<h2 class=\"doc-h\" id=\"pick-a-process\">Pick a process<a class=\"permalink\" href=\"__DOCS__/new-request-choose#pick-a-process\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ol class=\"num-list\"><li><div>Select a category.</div></li><li><div>Select a sub category.</div></li><li><div>Select the process.</div></li></ol>\n<p>The request form opens. See <a href=\"__DOCS__/new-request-submit\">Submit a request</a>.</p>\n<p>If you know the process name, type it in the box at the top of <strong>New Request</strong> and select it from the list. The list covers every process you can request, so you skip the category and sub category.</p>\n<p>Each process card shows:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">On the card</th><th scope=\"col\">What it means</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>SLA Duration</strong></td><td>The total time the steps are planned to take. See <a href=\"__DOCS__/request-sla\">Request deadlines and escalation</a>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Step Count</strong></td><td>How many approval steps the request goes through.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Held</strong></td><td>The process is temporarily out of use. <strong>From</strong> and <strong>To</strong> show the hold dates, when set.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"callout callout-note\"><p><strong>A held process is listed but can't be opened.</strong> Its card is greyed out until an administrator releases it. See <a href=\"__DOCS__/process-lifecycle\">Hold, release, move or copy a process</a>.</p></div>\n<p>To read a category, sub category or process description before opening it, select the information icon on its card.</p>\n<h2 class=\"doc-h\" id=\"related-topics\">Related topics<a class=\"permalink\" href=\"__DOCS__/new-request-choose#related-topics\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\">#</a></h2>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li><a href=\"__DOCS__/new-request-submit\">Submit a request</a></li><li><a href=\"__DOCS__/service-catalog\">Service catalog</a></li><li><a href=\"__DOCS__/user-groups\">User groups</a></li><li><a href=\"__DOCS__/requests-list\">Requests list</a></li></ul>"
      }
    ]
  },
